<title>USA: Pohatcong Twp., N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Pohatcong Twp., N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won $1.575 million of Pohatcong, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.75.</p>
</text>
